  "description": "Contract lifecycle (W1-T2): contract types; counterparty account and vendor, owner, type, parent contract, notice period, auto-renewal, renewal term, notice deadline, confidentiality and current terms on the contract (the old counterparty text kept); bilingual rich-text clauses with versions, a stable key, a standard position and fallbacks; obligation owner, who owes it, recurrence, evidence and reminders; amendment terms and status. Contracts, clauses, obligations and amendments are audited, and contract status, end date and obligation due date are filterable.",
